      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gladstone%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city sits at the confluence of the Willamette and Clackamas rivers, just 12 miles south of Portland.",
